# Smart E-Waste Management System

A Flask + SQLite web application for managing electronic waste.

## Features
- E-waste registration
- Category and condition management
- Reuse / Repair / Recycle recommendations
- Collection requests
- Dashboard statistics
- Recycling guide
- SQLite database
- Responsive UI

## Technologies
HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Python, Flask, SQLite

## Run
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
```
Open `http://127.0.0.1:5000`

The `ewaste.db` database is created automatically.
